WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.270
Hi, I'm Crimson. And I'm Archer.

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.900
Big updates just dropped at SavingPlanets.com!

3
00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:10.200
